2. metastases \>10
3. non-lung metastases;
4. incomplete clinical data;
5. metastases diameter \> 5 cm;
6. intrahepatic tumors \> 5, and tumor burden \> 1/2 liver volume;
7. PVTT type Vp 4;
8. lost to follow-up within 3 months.

