* In the opinion of the investigator, the participants have symptoms such as dermatitis or abnormal skin around the abdominal administration site;
* Participants with a history of severe drug or food allergies, who have used immunosuppressant drugs, or who are determined by the researcher to be allergic to the investigational drug;

Inclusion Criteria:

